{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "46e1218974327d2a85997fb14cc79828620c1875f1dcf3af6dbc0e4d358db8c3", "ja": "わたし達はPRETTY DREAMER！", "zh": "我们是『PRETTY DREAMER』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4dce3606a71c52a7318d0bf21424c06468f751af424877a8c4eaec7914148331", "ja": "リハーサルは順調だったものの本番を目前に\n控え、緊張してきてしまう奈緒。だが未来の\n「ばーんっ！」で、空気は一変する。\n夢を叶えるため、最高に楽しいライブにして\nみせるとメンバーはステージへと走り出す。", "zh": "尽管排练相当顺利，但正式公演举行在即，\n奈绪不禁开始紧张。不过在未来喊了「砰！」\n之后，紧张的氛围一扫而空。\n为了实现梦想，成员奔向舞台，\n表示要带来最欢乐的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "47db7277cb7cca52cad9662a5c66001a006de370866be88b5b3bfe2511f4e9d6", "ja": "（いよいよ、今日は本番だ。リハーサルは\nいい感じだった……この調子で頑張れ、皆！）", "zh": "（今天终于要正式表演了。排练时的感觉很不错……\n照这个步调继续加油吧，大家！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "cf1842fb25ea6b3dddeb52c6e5e38a505aff03037e5fdd1ae02233db63daf394", "ja": "みんな、さっきのリハーサル、\nすっごくいい感じだったぞっ！", "zh": "各位，\n刚刚的排练感觉很不错喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "de87754f23d048226a576aba2853768f04dee281c4acb72862b966cc2268aa63", "ja": "うん、バッチリだったと思うな。\nこれも、響ちゃんのレッスンのおかげだね。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得很完美喔。\n这也是多亏了响的训练呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "d25b3ae89079e4ed19216f624a003373ad0307eee1b0a6fd84724d748799204b", "ja": "厳しかったけど……歌もダンスも……、\n杏奈、前より上手になれた……よ……♪", "zh": "虽然训练很严格……不过杏奈的歌唱跟舞蹈……\n都比之前还要……进步了喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb0a408c8af4cdc1105eaeaf3079f70be4b6f3cd9de9ed2fddb33848df0b18a7", "ja": "私も、がんばったーって感じがする！\n本番、すっごく、すーっごく楽しみです♪", "zh": "我也觉得自己很努力了！\n真的、真～的好期待正式上场啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "a82492ddbac22203b6077515f97eee4b55b083dbc162eaa0cee827c3f1e023f0", "ja": "自分もさーっ！　みんなで公演、楽しもうねっ！", "zh": "本人也是啦──！我们一起享受公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "3fcb2664df4dac387ed5a7f2e84bd7e8b1c1e2fbf70d53322610d75e7a695f70", "ja": "せ、せやな……。", "zh": "对、对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "837ceeeb7957a393983aaf6a3ee0164d9386beb665e73f9169438fd5659852a7", "ja": "うん？　……奈緒、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯……？奈绪，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "893037c89f6fd946164d35abeeaf0f5f3fd39aa1fdbe5f5101ba1e99b72f557b", "ja": "いや……もうすぐ本番か思うと、緊張してきてもうて。\n心臓から口が飛び出しそうや……。", "zh": "没什么……只是一想到快要正式上场，就开始紧张了。\n感觉嘴巴都快要从心脏跳出来了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bd0e1bf36937064df5f117ed2900f59b61d12c5f410fe6dfc6f6ee51832c44f1", "ja": "それを言うなら、口から心臓が飛び出しそう、だろ。\nともあれ、どうしたものか……。", "zh": "那句话应该是「心脏都快要从嘴巴里跳出来」吧。\n不过，该怎么办才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e43b6d7cccc21263df2dce2b31d5d3a53590f48a8a4b6344e61a8f64d2533b2b", "ja": "そうだ、深呼吸してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "对了，深呼吸看看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "0c7c4bea8d7bb0443c7682a5cd6e3c5d6fa9e75053776767b7853b91a0fb11da", "ja": "もう、そんなんとっくにやってますって！\nめっちゃ空気吸っただけで、全然効果なかったわ……。", "zh": "吼唷，我当然已经做过了啊！\n结果只是吸了满肚子空气，一点效果也没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "8a7ed59ab907f56796a7df89e9953bdcd36df99aa54d069967ebfd25e3ada435", "ja": "アカン、どないしよ～！　せっかくここまで\nがんばってきたのに、本番で失敗したら意味ないわ！", "zh": "惨了，该怎么办才好～！好不容易才努力到这一步的，\n如果在正式上场时失败就没有意义啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "76b13cb7516b4ae136f844e9a33b4ec56f920b156ba3640d995b3903774a972e", "ja": "（ううん……。何か、奈緒の緊張をほぐす\nいい方法があればいいんだが……）", "zh": "（嗯……要是有什么好办法\n能消除奈绪的紧张就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "e40d933fb45052416e0b5baaec6a84e0faabd7c5474c2cb5d15058f5e091d73c", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん、ばーんっ！", "zh": "奈绪，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "122bdee3d9fdd9bcd8ef30a5dc4e614ef1cfe3ff5f9c6f02e5b267656f1de3e5", "ja": "ぐえーっ！", "zh": "呃啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "b69b2ed9b4a650c6f7e785bf6f806d1ab85fc69795a46a1c859b669456ece179", "ja": "……って、何やらすん、未来！？\nいつものクセで、ついノッてしもうたけど！", "zh": "……呃，未来你在做什么啊！？\n我平常太习惯，一不小心就配合演出了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "0ec5751bb53a8deee1e38c23b3e8e04690472ad08934e7a28cce1bbf8832fba8", "ja": "大阪の人は、どんな時でも撃たれたフリしてくれるって\n本当なのかなって気になっちゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "你之前说大阪人无论在什么时候，都会配合做出\n被枪击中的动作，我很好奇这是不是真的嘛……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "9e4e48320e3cc70d606836b60bbf5b35423072c1a2fa5bf196a9c056044a82a9", "ja": "本番直前やのに、ノンキやな、未来……。", "zh": "都快要正式上场了，你还真悠哉啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4440d7f4335f1917799ea9b5612ec77de975adef26273564089698d214d01ca8", "ja": "でも奈緒、未来のおかげで\n緊張がほぐれたんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过奈绪，托未来的福，\n你是不是已经没那么紧张了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "0a869a23abf5d171201cfc7671fa8d8af00e33c3ffd9e10d405130e3aca9fce7", "ja": "ほっ……ホンマや。まさか未来、\n私をリラックスさせるためにやってくれたん！？", "zh": "啊……真的耶。\n难不成未来你是为了让我放松才那么做的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "欸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e483646869bdb3225a9e67b9458338a8e43708c6db564d5d640cdadd3bba900b", "ja": "そういうわけではなかったみたいだな……\nでも、よくやった、未来。", "zh": "看来并非这么回事……\n不过，做得好，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "e9125677585994a0805a317181a5a2d00b3ae45796f85f1da010eb8a78dd1bea", "ja": "えへへ、なんだかよくわかりませんけど、\nほめられちゃいました♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，虽然不太懂为什么，\n但是我被夸奖了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "d4c2da16e5fa8efdacf0c91a6c9f8641fdf96f5c5d9b9750c0ca065fd976104d", "ja": "ホンマに何も考えてなかったんやな……。\nま、そのほうが未来らしいわ♪", "zh": "原来真的什么都没在想……\n算了，这样才像未来嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "aefe51e3de173214e54ca621547990daaed338fd989e6611b7042c1620ff41b3", "ja": "『関西の星』になるためにも、\nここでつまずいてなんていられへん！", "zh": "为了成为『关西之星』，\n我也不能在这里被绊住脚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "b3e50a15fe2dd744054775c5a6b783924593999a8340474df4a9987316e13148", "ja": "夢を叶えるために、\n私の全力、出し切ってくるわ！", "zh": "为了实现梦想，\n我要使出浑身解数啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "25f15dc2f2174367fc684ed321d8b92623ec85178ed09fb0a33b443ae05e5efe", "ja": "私たちの『PRETTY DREAMER』初披露かぁ……\nふふっ、ドキドキするね！", "zh": "这是我们的『PRETTY DREAMER』首次亮相啊……\n呵呵，真令人兴奋呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e17245f4bc9fe237cd8053feb3bcddd3781f2e7f9c5df1e12aab6a65a41989a", "ja": "うん……。杏奈、会場のみんなと……\n目いっぱい、楽しんでくる……♪", "zh": "嗯……杏奈会跟会场中的大家一起……\n全心全意尽情享受……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "de2e55f1e5cde33026b1a32e959221c70328d4321968aa24c420a48cf0aa65c1", "ja": "自分たちもファンの皆も、\nサイコーに楽しいライブにしてくるぞ！", "zh": "要带来一场让我们跟粉丝都\n玩个痛快的演唱会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "e7c7bb6f74f26cac0650a071d7e7ba159d4722a5c0ff083b51ecb20fddbf0872", "ja": "私たちのステージ、見ててくださいね、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "请好好看着我们的表演喔，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5e9e27075f146ddd52e4dcf6e92fd78e584f363f872efe14e3b251b1d73a6d31", "ja": "ああ、行ってこい！", "zh": "好，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
